entries[442799] = { ["name"] = "Sanguine Overflow", ["text"] = "300 yd range\nInstant\nThe canister of Black Blood leaks its contents across the floor of the chamber, slowly growing in size. This pool inflicts 287816 Shadow damage and absorbs the next 490734 healing received every 0.5 sec from players within the effect.\n\nExperimental Eggs that come in contact with the pool trigger a Caustic Reaction ." }
entries[442801] = { ["name"] = "Wildfire Wick", ["text"] = "50 yd range\nInstant\nYour melee attacks have a chance to set the target ablaze, dealing ( 53 * 11) Fire damage over 11 sec.\n\nTriggering this effect while the target is already burning refreshes the duration while also spreading to a nearby enemy." }
