entries[443028] = { ["name"] = "Celestial Conduit", ["text"] = "5% of base mana\nChanneled (4 sec cast) 1.5 min cooldown\nWindwalker\nThe August Celestials empower you, causing you to radiate [(1100% of Attack Power) * 5] Nature damage onto enemies and [(1100% of Spell Power) * 5] healing onto up to 5 injured allies within 15 yds over 4 sec, split evenly among them. Healing and damage increased by 6% per enemy struck, up to 30%.\n\nYou may move while channeling, but casting other healing or damaging spells cancels this effect.\n\nMistweaver\nThe August Celestials empower you, causing you to radiate [(1100% of Spell Power) * 5] healing onto up to 5 injured allies and [(1100% of Attack Power) * 5] Nature damage onto enemies within 20 yds over 4 sec, split evenly among them. Healing and damage increased by 6% per target, up to 30%.\n\nYou may move while channeling, but casting other healing or damaging spells cancels this effect." }
